5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I need to know if this budget covers the full cost, not just the start.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,We have buried too many projects. I want to see what actually worked before.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,Rosters are where new programs land. I need to see the staffing reality.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about the physical space. Can the rooms and parking handle more?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Things break in year two. I want to see where recent starts failed.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, past failures are useful, but I need the current financial baseline first.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, the baseline is useless if the model is already broken. I will check the data.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, space is important, but if there are no nurses, the rooms are empty.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, true. But if the car park is full, patients can't even get in.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, I agree. Staffing is the foundation. I will look at the joint clinic minutes.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will check the development allocation and the regional fund tariffs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will review the readmission figures and the booking system records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will examine the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy staffing review.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I will look at rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and the booking system.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will read the board minutes on the jointly run clinic and the data agreements.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Let us see what the numbers say before we guess.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,The data will show us the truth. I am ready to look.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope the staffing data is clear. It is the most critical part.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I am curious to see how full the car park really is.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I trust the records will tell us where the cracks are.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
